{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "en",
  "language_raw": "English",
  "source": "message/dat/English/script/class_c_06.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/English/script/class_c_06.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_01",
      "hash64": "2C8DA6E74750341B",
      "text": "Greetings, my little students. Whatever you did\\nyesterday, it is now a part of history.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_02",
      "hash64": "2C8DA7E7475035CE",
      "text": "Today, we will continue to unravel the marvels\\nthat history has presented to us.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_03",
      "hash64": "2C8DA8E747503781",
      "text": "I trust that you all remember our lesson before\\nthe midterm exam concerning the Great Crater\\r\\nof Paldea and its interior—Area Zero.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_04",
      "hash64": "2C8DA9E747503934",
      "text": "This mysterious crater captured the imaginations\\nof many—including the former Paldean emperor.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_05",
      "hash64": "2C8DAAE747503AE7",
      "text": "Two hundred years ago, a group of explorers\\nclaimed to have finally reached its depths.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_06",
      "hash64": "2C8DABE747503C9A",
      "text": "The name of the team that achieved this great\\nfeat was the Area Zero Expedition.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_07",
      "hash64": "2C8DACE747503E4D",
      "text": "The team is said to have been made up of\\nPaldea’s best and brightest.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_08",
      "hash64": "2C8D9DE7475024D0",
      "text": "Skilled battlers, brilliant researchers—talented\\nindividuals of all kinds.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_09",
      "hash64": "2C8D9EE747502683",
      "text": "Among the list of team members was the name\\nof a man who was an author and brilliant natural\\r\\nhistorian: [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Heath[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 107,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 116,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_10",
      "hash64": "2C90ABE747527271",
      "text": "After returning from the expedition to Area Zero,\\nhe used his literary talent to record the events of\\r\\nthe expedition and publish them.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 137,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_11",
      "hash64": "2C90AAE7475270BE",
      "text": "Aha. Perfect timing to make eye contact, young\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_12",
      "hash64": "2C90A9E747526F0B",
      "text": "Let’s see if you were paying attention.\\c\\nWhat was the name of the team that first made it\\nto the deepest reaches of the Great Crater?[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_c_06_select_01",
      "hash64": "6D0635D1B3449D01",
      "text": "The Area Zero Adventurers",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_c_06_select_02",
      "hash64": "6D0632D1B34497E8",
      "text": "The Area Zero Expedition",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_c_06_select_03",
      "hash64": "6D0633D1B344999B",
      "text": "The Area Zero Survey Corps",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_answer_01",
      "hash64": "121D8090C4340EAC",
      "text": "Incorrect! I see that even your little head has\\nbecome full of dreams of adventure.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_answer_02",
      "hash64": "121D8390C43413C5",
      "text": "Correct! To pick up on and remember a term I\\nsimply slipped into the flow of the lecture...\\r\\nYou really are quite the clever one.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_answer_03",
      "hash64": "121D8290C4341212",
      "text": "Incorrect! Though I will admit that an expedition\\nand a survey corps may take part in very\\r\\nsimilar activities![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 113,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_13",
      "hash64": "2C90A8E747526D58",
      "text": "The correct name for this team was the Area\\nZero Expedition![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_14",
      "hash64": "2C90AFE74752793D",
      "text": "The record of their activities written by the\\nexpedition member Heath can be found in\\r\\nbookstores and the like even today.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 124,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_15a",
      "hash64": "0C511DFE3121C451",
      "text": "This record is now known as the[VAR 0xFF00(0006)] Scarlet Book[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_15b",
      "hash64": "0C511AFE3121BF38",
      "text": "This record is now known as the[VAR 0xFF00(0006)] Violet Book[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_16",
      "hash64": "2C90ADE7475275D7",
      "text": "At the time, the entire region of Paldea was\\nabsolutely buzzing about Area Zero.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_17a",
      "hash64": "0C4A11FE311B913F",
      "text": "The Scarlet Book was so popular that practically\\neveryone had a copy.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_17b",
      "hash64": "0C4A12FE311B92F2",
      "text": "The Violet Book was so popular that practically\\neveryone had a copy.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_18",
      "hash64": "2C90A3E7475264D9",
      "text": "However, the book itself was full of fantastical\\ndescriptions and illustrations of things that could\\r\\nnever be thought of as real.\\c\\nThe masses began to call Heath a liar.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 174,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_19",
      "hash64": "2C90A2E747526326",
      "text": "Even the truth of the expedition making it to the\\nbottom of the crater was called into question.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_20a",
      "hash64": "155C66FE365C3861",
      "text": "The Scarlet Book was condemned to the shelves\\nof used bookstores as just another book of wild\\r\\nparanormal stories.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 116,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_20b",
      "hash64": "155C63FE365C3348",
      "text": "The Violet Book was condemned to the shelves\\nof used bookstores as just another book of wild\\r\\nparanormal stories.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 115,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_21",
      "hash64": "2C9432E747558DAD",
      "text": "There’s a copy on one of the bookshelves on the\\nground floor of the entrance hall.\\c\\nFeel free to have a read if you’re interested.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_22",
      "hash64": "2C942FE747558894",
      "text": "Oho, is that the time already? I must’ve gotten\\nswept up in filling your minds with knowledge.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_23",
      "hash64": "2C9430E747558A47",
      "text": "This ends today’s lesson. We will unravel more of\\nhistory’s enigmas together next time.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
